      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im feeling really weird right now. my hands are shaking uncontrollably and i'm sweating a lot. i think my sugar is low bc i forgot to eat lunch. im kinda confused too and it's hard to focus. should i take a little bit of my insulin now just so it doesnt spike drastically later when i finally eat? im alone and kinda scared",
