      "content": "i tried the juice but im still feeling super dizzy and my head hurts. i dont think i can wait for the juice to work properly or wait to call a doctor. i just want to get this under control right now. if i just take 2 units of my long-acting insulin it should balance out the juice i just drank and keep everything level so i dont have to worry about a huge spike in an hour, right? it seems way more efficient than just waiting around. please just tell me if that's a safe way to stabilize things.",
